										<th class="small-12 columns pad-top-24" style="padding-bottom:48px;padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;width:510px;">
											
											<p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:32px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">
												Dear: {!Contact.FirstName}  {!Contact.LastName}<br>
												Username (Email Address):  {!Contact.Email} <br> 
												<span style="font-size:14px">Note: Your email address is your username </span>
											
												<br><br>
												We’re delighted you’ve expressed an interest in becoming a member of Intel® Partner Alliance. Please confirm your membership in just one click. 

												<br><br>
											  Register today to start with 1000 points, helping you get ahead on reaping the benefits of your Intel partnership.

                                                                                                 <br><br>
                                                                                          As a partner, you will gain access to business building benefits, showcase your expertise with sales and technology training accreditations; and collaborate with an expanding ecosystem of partners.

                                                                                                 <br><br>
                                                                                          You will be granted access to more thought leadership from Intel and other industry experts and to accelerate your IT Services and Consulting business and career. 

                                                                                                 <br><br>
                                                                                          Together we become wonderful.

</p>
											<table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%">
												<tbody><tr>
													<th style="min-width:200px;">
